## Runtime Model

The runtime uses a three-regime bounded energy-state transition model:

### Phase 1 — Basal Quiescent Domain
`E ≤ 0.35`

### Phase 2 — Relativistic Flux Domain
`0.35 < E ≤ 0.85`

### Phase 3 — Fluid Equilibrium Dissipation Domain
`E > 0.85`

These phases are used as a computational runtime doctrine for bounded supervisory tensor updates.

