## Benchmarks

Official benchmark packs are located in:

- `benchmarks/benchmark-small/`
- `benchmarks/benchmark-medium/`
- `benchmarks/benchmark-cluster/`
- `benchmarks/benchmark-85b-logical/`

Each benchmark includes:

- benchmark-specific config
- expected result definition
- reference hash fields
- execution instructions

### Example benchmark run

```bash
python scripts/run_benchmark.py \
  --config benchmarks/benchmark-small/config.yaml \
  --track "Track B - Deterministic Reproducibility" \
  --benchmark-name benchmark-small \
  --artifact-dir artifacts/output/benchmark-small \
  --world-size 1
```

### Validate emitted artifacts

```bash
python scripts/validate_artifacts.py \
  --artifact-dir artifacts/output/benchmark-small
```

### Compare against seeded reference

```bash
python scripts/compare_benchmark.py \
  --artifact-dir artifacts/output/benchmark-small \
  --expected-result benchmarks/benchmark-small/expected_result.json
```

