## Fault Injection

Official fault scenarios are located in:

- `fault_injection/nan_injection/`
- `fault_injection/halo_failure/`
- `fault_injection/checkpoint_corruption/`
- `fault_injection/unauthorized_control/`
- `fault_injection/stale_step_replay/`

These scenarios are intended to validate:

- integrity failure detection
- rollback behavior
- quiescence behavior
- governed commit blocking
- control-path rejection

### Example real fault run

```bash
python scripts/run_fault.py \
  --scenario-file fault_injection/nan_injection/scenario.json \
  --config benchmarks/benchmark-medium/config.yaml \
  --artifact-dir artifacts/output/fault-nan \
  --release-tag local
```

### Validate fault artifacts

```bash
python scripts/validate_artifacts.py \
  --artifact-dir artifacts/output/fault-nan
```

