## Reproducibility Policy

Reproducibility is defined within a **validated runtime envelope**, including:

- fixed code version
- fixed dependency versions
- fixed deterministic settings
- fixed benchmark config
- fixed launch topology
- compatible hardware/runtime class

This repository does not claim universal determinism across all possible environments.

